  "extras": "<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"621.0\" y=\"37\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"621.0\" dy=\"0\">Conditional BatchNorm / two condition heads  |  Module overview</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"621.0\" y=\"65\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"621.0\" dy=\"0\">static module / explicit profile  /  read bottom to top</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"76.0\" y=\"671\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f8d4e1\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"99.0\" y=\"684\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"99.0\" dy=\"0\">Inputs</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"261.0\" y=\"671\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#ffddb3\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"284.0\" y=\"684\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"284.0\" dy=\"0\">Module</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"446.0\" y=\"671\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#dfdff8\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"469.0\" y=\"684\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"469.0\" dy=\"0\">Linear</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"631.0\" y=\"671\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff6bd\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"654.0\" y=\"684\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"654.0\" dy=\"0\">Norm / math</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"816.0\" y=\"671\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#cdeaf8\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"839.0\" y=\"684\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"839.0\" dy=\"0\">Reshape</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"1001.0\" y=\"671\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#dfdff8\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"1024.0\" y=\"684\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"1024.0\" dy=\"0\">Outputs</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"621.0\" y=\"712\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"621.0\" dy=\"0\">Bottom-to-top; independent outputs are parallel, never an implicit tensor chain</tspan>\n<tspan x=\"621.0\" dy=\"16.52\">Colors denote roles; Parameter / buffer / ordinary state are recorded separately in IR</tspan>\n<tspan x=\"621.0\" dy=\"16.52\">Fixed source symbols + explicit profile; library operators are call boundaries</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"621.0\" y=\"816\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"621.0\" dy=\"0\">Reviewed static source + selected profile. Repeated groups are templates; shapes are not runtime observations.</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"621.0\" y=\"846\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"621.0\" dy=\"0\">E### = source span; dashed = side / shape dependencies; fork/join roles are typed in IR; no implicit sum.</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"621.0\" y=\"871\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"621.0\" dy=\"0\">Repeated colors encode operation roles. Shared weights and independent instances are recorded in semantic_ir.json.</tspan>\n</text>\n",
